# Only used when a service's build context is the repo root (currently just
# tracebridge-investigator, which needs to COPY both its own source and a
# sibling copy of tracebridge-mcp into one image). Every other service
# builds with its own directory as context and has its own .dockerignore.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/logs
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/target
.git
